{"seq":1,"slug":"coupon-template-types","title":"券模板、券种与适用范围","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/coupon-center-lifecycle/coupon-model-batch/coupon-template-types","wordCount":2541,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"券模板-券种与适用范围\">券模板、券种与适用范围</h1><p>优惠券在数据模型上最容易被做坏的地方，是把它当成「一张打折卡」直接挂在商品上。一旦这么设计，很快就会出现三种互相打架的需求：运营要能改规则而不影响已发出的券、财务要能按券种算出成本、风控要能解释「这张券为什么不能用在那个商品上」。这三件事分别要求券的定义有不同的时间语义——规则属于模板（可改）、成本属于批次（冻结）、可用性属于实例（最终确定）。把它们混成一个实体，任何一次运营改配置都会污染历史券的成本口径。</p>\n<p>本文建立券的定义层：模板、券种与适用范围。批次如何承接模板并冻结预算属于下一层的议题，见 <a href=\"batch-budget\">券批次、总量与预算</a>；券如何被实例化成码属于生成层，见 <a href=\"coupon-code-system\">券码生成与批量导入</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-模板-批次-实例三层-各自冻结不同的东西\">核心概念：模板 / 批次 / 实例三层，各自冻结不同的东西</h2><p>券的定义必须拆成三层，拆分的依据是「什么会变、变了影响谁」：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层</th>\n<th>承载什么</th>\n<th>可变性</th>\n<th>变更影响面</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>券模板（template）</td>\n<td>券型、面额规则、适用范围、叠加规则、有效期规则</td>\n<td>可版本化修改</td>\n<td>只影响版本生效后新建的批次</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>券批次（batch）</td>\n<td>总量、每人限领、预算池、发放渠道、生效时间窗</td>\n<td>极少改，改了必须审计</td>\n<td>已发出的实例不受影响，未发出的受剩余量影响</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>券实例（instance）</td>\n<td>券码 / 券 ID、归属用户、状态、最终面额与适用范围快照</td>\n<td>只随状态机变化</td>\n<td>用户可见的那一张</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键约定只有一条：<strong>实例在创建时对模板做快照</strong>。快照不是复制全量字段，而是记录「模板 ID + 模板版本号 + 本次实例化时求值得到的面额与范围」。用户在券到期前看到的规则必须与他下单时系统执行的规则一致，因此执行侧只能读快照，不能读模板当前值。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    T[&quot;券模板 template&lt;br/&gt;券型/面额规则/范围/叠加&quot;] --&gt; TV[&quot;模板版本 v1..vN&lt;br/&gt;每次修改生成新版本&quot;]&#10;    TV --&gt; B1[&quot;批次 batch A&lt;br/&gt;总量 10000 / 每人 1 张&quot;]&#10;    TV --&gt; B2[&quot;批次 batch B&lt;br/&gt;总量 5000 / 定向人群&quot;]&#10;    B1 --&gt; I1[&quot;券实例&lt;br/&gt;user_42 / UNUSED&quot;]&#10;    B1 --&gt; I2[&quot;券实例&lt;br/&gt;user_88 / USED&quot;]&#10;    B2 --&gt; I3[&quot;券实例&lt;br/&gt;user_42 / LOCKED&quot;]&#10;    I1 --&gt;|下单占用| LK[&quot;订单锁券&quot;]&#10;    LK --&gt;|支付成功| US[&quot;核销&quot;]&#10;    LK --&gt;|订单取消| RB[&quot;退回卡包&quot;]\">graph TD\n    T[\"券模板 template&lt;br/&gt;券型/面额规则/范围/叠加\"] --&gt; TV[\"模板版本 v1..vN&lt;br/&gt;每次修改生成新版本\"]\n    TV --&gt; B1[\"批次 batch A&lt;br/&gt;总量 10000 / 每人 1 张\"]\n    TV --&gt; B2[\"批次 batch B&lt;br/&gt;总量 5000 / 定向人群\"]\n    B1 --&gt; I1[\"券实例&lt;br/&gt;user_42 / UNUSED\"]\n    B1 --&gt; I2[\"券实例&lt;br/&gt;user_88 / USED\"]\n    B2 --&gt; I3[\"券实例&lt;br/&gt;user_42 / LOCKED\"]\n    I1 --&gt;|下单占用| LK[\"订单锁券\"]\n    LK --&gt;|支付成功| US[\"核销\"]\n    LK --&gt;|订单取消| RB[\"退回卡包\"]</pre><p>消费者侧看到的「我的券」是这个图里最右侧一列；运营配置界面看的是最左侧；而财务核算看的是中间那一列。三层分开之后，一次运营改配置不会改写任何已发出实例，一次审计也不需要在成千上万条实例里反推当年的规则。</p>\n<h2 id=\"券种的经济学分类与算价接口\">券种的经济学分类与算价接口</h2><p>券种决定了「券值多少钱」这个函数的形状。工程上不该按业务名字分类，而该按<strong>算价函数的参数个数与单调性</strong>分类，因为这才是它和订单金额的耦合方式。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>券种</th>\n<th>算价表达式</th>\n<th>关键参数</th>\n<th>对订单金额的依赖</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>直减（满 N 元可用）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d = \\min(v, A)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>≥</mo><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A \\ge N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>面额 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span>、门槛 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>仅门槛判定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>满减（阶梯）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>∣</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d = \\max\\{v_k \\mid A \\ge N_k\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>阶梯集合 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\{(N_k, v_k)\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)}</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>单调递增查表</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>折扣（封顶）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mi>A</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d = \\min(\\rho A,\\; C)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>折扣率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span></span></span></span></span>、封顶 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>线性 + 封顶</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>免邮</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d = s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span>（运费）</td>\n<td>无面额</td>\n<td>依赖运费字段</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>兑换/赠品</td>\n<td>非金额，产生一个商品行</td>\n<td>兑换品 SKU</td>\n<td>不参与金额</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这里的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 是<strong>券适用范围过滤后的参与金额</strong>，而不是订单总额——这个区分是绝大多数「券算多了」缺陷的根源。参与金额的计算必须与范围过滤共用同一套匹配结果，否则席位上会出现「商品被排除掉了但它的金额还在参与满减」这种自相矛盾。</p>\n<p>折扣券的封顶参数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 在多市场场景下必须与币种绑定（见 <a href=\"../global-coupon/multi-currency-coupon\">多币种券金额与展示</a>），因为「满 100 减 20」的 100 在不同币种下的购买力差异可能有两个数量级。</p>\n<p>还有一类容易漏掉的券种是<strong>非金额型</strong>：加赠、抽奖资格、免运费门槛直通、会员体验卡。它们的共同特征是不改变订单应付金额，而是改变订单的<strong>行项目集合</strong>或<strong>后续流程</strong>。工程上的处理办法是让券的求值返回值是一个<strong>效果列表</strong>而不是一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span> 金额：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;couponId&quot;: &quot;c_8891&quot;,&#10;  &quot;effects&quot;: [&#10;    { &quot;kind&quot;: &quot;AMOUNT_OFF&quot;, &quot;target&quot;: &quot;ORDER&quot;, &quot;value&quot;: { &quot;minor&quot;: 2000, &quot;currency&quot;: &quot;SGD&quot; } },&#10;    { &quot;kind&quot;: &quot;FREE_SHIPPING&quot;, &quot;target&quot;: &quot;SHIPPING&quot;, &quot;maxMinor&quot;: 800 }&#10;  ]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"couponId\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"c_8891\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"effects\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"kind\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"AMOUNT_OFF\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"target\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ORDER\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"minor\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"currency\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SGD\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"kind\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"FREE_SHIPPING\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"target\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SHIPPING\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"maxMinor\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">800</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>效果列表的好处是价格引擎可以按固定顺序叠加多种效果，而不需要为每一种组合写一条分支。求值的<strong>执行</strong>属于价格引擎，券中心只负责产出这个列表——这条边界一旦模糊，券中心就会开始复制价格引擎的税费与运费逻辑，随后两边开始漂移。</p>\n<h2 id=\"适用范围-五级粒度与匹配算法\">适用范围：五级粒度与匹配算法</h2><p>范围规则的语言必须能表达运营真实的说话方式，同时又能被编译成一次快速的匹配。实际可用的粒度是五级，它们构成一棵包含树：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>粒度</th>\n<th>表达</th>\n<th>典型场景</th>\n<th>匹配成本</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>平台</td>\n<td>全站</td>\n<td>大促通用券</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>站点/市场</td>\n<td><code>market=SG</code></td>\n<td>分市场发券</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 位图</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>店铺</td>\n<td><code>shop_id</code> 集合</td>\n<td>品牌券</td>\n<td>集合判定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>类目</td>\n<td>类目树节点</td>\n<td>品类券</td>\n<td>依赖类目祖先链</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单品</td>\n<td>SKU / SPU 集合</td>\n<td>清库存</td>\n<td>位图 / 布隆</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>include 与 exclude 必须同时存在，且<strong>exclude 的优先级高于 include</strong>。这是运营最容易踩的坑：写了「全场 8 折，但排除 iPhone」，如果没有 exclude 语义，运营只能把除 iPhone 外的所有类目逐个加进 include，而类目树每次调整都会让这份清单过期。</p>\n<p>匹配的实现有两种常见策略，取舍在于范围规则的复杂度：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>规则求值式</strong>：把范围编译成谓词，对订单每一行求值。灵活性最高，适合行数少的订单，缺点是每次算价都要走一遍规则树。</li>\n<li><strong>位图/倒排式</strong>：把「哪些券适用于这个 SKU」预计算成倒排索引或位图（roaring bitmap 之类），算价时直接取交集。适合 SKU 数量大、券数量中等的平台，把成本从算价路径挪到发券路径。Roaring 相比 RLE 系压缩位图（WAH/Concise）在实测中交集运算可快至数百倍（来源：Roaring Bitmaps, Software: Practice and Experience 46(5):709–719, 2016, <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/1402.6407）。\">https://arxiv.org/abs/1402.6407）。</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>平台的商品量在千万级时，位图方案的代价是每次新增券要写一批位图。折中做法是对高粒度（平台/市场）走求值、对低粒度（单品集合）走位图，把两类规则的成本放在最合适的地方。单品集合若规模极端，也可退化为布隆过滤器，以固定内存换取可容忍的假阳性率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi><mo>≈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi><mi>n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow></msup><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>k</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon \\approx (1-e^{-kn/m})^k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4831em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.138em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（最优哈希个数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k=(m/n)\\ln 2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ln</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span>）（来源：Bloom filter 假阳性率公式, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bloom_filter）。\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bloom_filter）。</a></p>\n<p>范围还有一个时间维度：<strong>范围是模板的一部分，但它的生效时间属于批次</strong>。同一张模板的「端午专享券」范围不变，而在两个不同季度投放的批次可能有不同的商品清单。因此范围规则需要支持「批次级覆盖」，覆盖后的结果同样写入实例快照。</p>\n<h2 id=\"叠加与互斥-组合空间的约束\">叠加与互斥：组合空间的约束</h2><p>券能不能一起用，是营销策略问题，但必须落成可计算的约束，否则每次大促都会出现「三种券叠出一个负价」的工单。约束的基本单位是<strong>互斥组（exclusivity group）</strong>：同一组内最多命中一张。</p>\n<p>组合空间有四个层次，从粗到细依次收紧：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>券种类别维度：金额券与折扣券通常互斥，运费券常可与金额券叠加。</li>\n<li>互斥组维度：运营按活动建组，组内唯一。</li>\n<li>门槛维度：叠加后的参与金额是否仍满足各券门槛——这一条最容易被忽略。两张券叠用时，第二张券的门槛应当基于<strong>第一张券扣减后的金额</strong>还是原始金额，必须在模板里显式声明，不能靠实现顺序决定。</li>\n<li>预算维度：叠加后的总让利是否超过批次预算（见 <a href=\"batch-budget\">券批次、总量与预算</a>）。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>选择顺序也不是实现细节：当用户有多张券可用而只能选一张时，<strong>最优组合</strong>才是用户期望的默认值。这是一个小规模的组合优化问题——在券数量有限（通常 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\le 20</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span></span></span></span></span>）时用带剪枝的搜索即可；把它做对的收益是新客转化率上的可观差异，而不是一个技术炫技。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;订单行集合 + 用户券包&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;范围过滤&lt;br/&gt;include/exclude&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;门槛判定&lt;br/&gt;逐券独立&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;互斥组约束&lt;br/&gt;组内唯一&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;求最优组合&lt;br/&gt;让利最大化&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;叠加门槛复检&lt;br/&gt;扣减后金额&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; G[&quot;预算与风控校验&lt;br/&gt;批次剩余&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt; H[&quot;效果列表输出&lt;br/&gt;交价格引擎&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[\"订单行集合 + 用户券包\"] --&gt; B[\"范围过滤&lt;br/&gt;include/exclude\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"门槛判定&lt;br/&gt;逐券独立\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"互斥组约束&lt;br/&gt;组内唯一\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"求最优组合&lt;br/&gt;让利最大化\"]\n    E --&gt; F[\"叠加门槛复检&lt;br/&gt;扣减后金额\"]\n    F --&gt; G[\"预算与风控校验&lt;br/&gt;批次剩余\"]\n    G --&gt; H[\"效果列表输出&lt;br/&gt;交价格引擎\"]</pre><p>这张流程图的每一步都是<strong>单调收紧</strong>的：后面的步骤只做减法不做加法，因此任何一步失败都不会让前面的结论变得不成立。这个性质让整个链路可以被缓存——范围过滤的结果可以按订单行集合哈希缓存，跨用户复用，是券中心算价性能的主要来源。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>券的定义分三层：模板管规则、批次管数量与预算、实例管最终可用性；<strong>实例必须在生成时快照规则</strong>，执行侧只读快照。</li>\n<li>券种按算价函数分类比按业务名分类更可靠；非金额型券的求值结果应是<strong>效果列表</strong>而非单一减价金额。</li>\n<li>参与金额 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 必须与范围过滤共用同一份匹配结果，否则会出现「已排除商品仍在参与满减」的矛盾。</li>\n<li>适用范围支持平台/站点/店铺/类目/单品五级，<strong>exclude 优先于 include</strong>；高粒度走规则求值、低粒度走位图是成本最优的折中。</li>\n<li>叠加规则必须显式声明门槛复检的基准金额，并在约束顺序上保持单调收紧，才能安全缓存。</li>\n<li>券中心只产出效果列表，算价执行属于价格引擎——越界的直接后果是税费与运费逻辑被复制两遍。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"券模板、券种与适用范围","id":"券模板-券种与适用范围"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：模板 / 批次 / 实例三层，各自冻结不同的东西","id":"核心概念-模板-批次-实例三层-各自冻结不同的东西"},{"level":2,"text":"券种的经济学分类与算价接口","id":"券种的经济学分类与算价接口"},{"level":2,"text":"适用范围：五级粒度与匹配算法","id":"适用范围-五级粒度与匹配算法"},{"level":2,"text":"叠加与互斥：组合空间的约束","id":"叠加与互斥-组合空间的约束"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"券批次、总量与预算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/coupon-center-lifecycle/coupon-model-batch/batch-budget"}}